1490..1570 Comment "/// The outer region keeps a slot; the inner scope holds `l` and lends a view of"
1571..1651 Comment "/// it; keeping that view in the outer slot is refused at the write — the view"
1652..1694 Comment "/// would outlive the access that lent it."
